    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION ON 16/10/2026 - 12.00 to 14.00***\n\nDetails can be obtained via link below . Please copy and paste this into your browser:\nhttps://raheny.dngauctions.ie/lot/details/d51187a0-a937-4e7a-b4e4-68f941cc31dc\n\n\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 99 Grattan Lodge, a four-bedroom semi-detached house ideally positioned within this mature and well-established residential development in Donaghmede, Dublin 13.\n\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and benefits from gardens to both the front and rear. The accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, living room, dining room, kitchen, storage area and guest WC. Upstairs, there are four bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from an ensuite, together with a family bathroom. There is also an attic room providing additional useful space.\n\nThe property enjoys good gardens to the front and rear, with the rear garden providing a private outdoor area and scope for a purchaser to make it their own.\n\nWhile the property would benefit from some updating, it offers generous accommodation and a practical layout, making it an appealing choice for those looking for a spacious family home in a convenient Dublin 13 location.\n\nDonaghmede is a popular residential area which is well served by a host of local amenities, including schools, shops, sporting and recreational facilities. The area is also well serviced by public transport, providing ease of access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The nearby coastal villages of Howth, Sutton and Baldoyle are also within easy reach.\n\nViewing is recommended to appreciate the accommodation and potential this property has to offer."
      },
